						<text class="demo-rd-label">placement="start" · 默认</text>
						<vx-radio-group v-model="plan" layout="list">
							<vx-radio value="basic" label="基础版" />
							<vx-radio value="pro" label="专业版" />
						</vx-radio-group>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-rd-stage demo-rd-stage--next">
						<text class="demo-rd-label">placement="end"</text>
						<vx-radio-group v-model="plan" layout="list" placement="end">
							<vx-radio value="basic" label="基础版" />
							<vx-radio value="pro" label="专业版" />
						</vx-radio-group>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">行尾标记和文案之间是弹性留白；整行可点，热区不受标记位置影响。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="样式与尺寸" desc="variant 切圆圈或只画对号；size 三档 28 / 32 / 36。" />
					<view class="demo-rd-stage">
						<text class="demo-rd-label">variant="circle" · 默认</text>
						<vx-radio-group v-model="plan">
							<vx-radio value="basic" label="圆圈" />
							<vx-radio value="pro" label="加对号" />
						</vx-radio-group>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-rd-stage demo-rd-stage--next">
						<text class="demo-rd-label">variant="check" · 只画对号</text>
