								<vx-radio value="m" label="lg 组" />
							</vx-radio-group>
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">同一组只用一档尺寸；对号样式没有描边，borderColor 对它不生效。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="类型" desc="type 改选中标记的语义色；warning 用 warning-pressed 填充。" />
					<view class="demo-rd-stage">
						<vx-radio-group v-model="tone" type="primary">
							<vx-radio value="p" label="primary" />
							<vx-radio value="s" label="success" />
						</vx-radio-group>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-rd-stage demo-rd-stage--next">
						<vx-radio-group v-model="tone" type="success">
							<vx-radio value="p" label="success 组" />
						</vx-radio-group>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-rd-stage demo-rd-stage--next">
						<vx-radio-group v-model="tone" type="warning">
							<vx-radio value="p" label="warning 组" />
						</vx-radio-group>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-rd-stage demo-rd-stage--next">
						<vx-radio-group v-model="tone" type="danger">
							<vx-radio value="p" label="danger 组" />
						</vx-radio-group>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">语义色表达状态，不用于装饰；普通选项组用 primary 或 default。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="自定义颜色" desc="color 改填充，borderColor 改未选中描边，checkColor 改对号。" />
					<view class="demo-rd-stage">
						<vx-radio-group v-model="colorDemo">
							<vx-radio value="a" label="color · #8a2b33" color="#8a2b33" />
							<vx-radio value="b" label="borderColor · #2f6f4f" border-color="#2f6f4f" />
						</vx-radio-group>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-rd-stage demo-rd-stage--next">
						<vx-radio-group v-model="colorDemo" variant="check">
							<vx-radio value="a" label="checkColor · #7a5b13" check-color="#7a5b13" />
							<vx-radio value="b" label="默认 primary" />
						</vx-radio-group>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">三者都是字面值、不跟随主题；checkColor 优先于 color，禁用时都不生效。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="状态与组合" desc="单项禁用不抛 change；整组禁用一起转灰；extra 贴行尾。" />
