					<view class="demo-rd-stage demo-rd-stage--next">
						<text class="demo-rd-label">整组禁用</text>
						<vx-radio-group v-model="plan" disabled>
							<vx-radio value="basic" label="基础版" />
							<vx-radio value="pro" label="专业版" />
						</vx-radio-group>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">extra 排在文案后方；标记在行尾时它落在文案与标记之间。禁用原因写在外层说明里。</text>
